            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[- The compact sidebar playlist card has separate controls for reloading and opening its menu.
- The reload arrow spins while the provider is contacted. Xtream reloads show movies, series and live channels in sequence, then confirm when the catalogue has been saved.
- The playlist menu shows account expiry and connection counts when Xtream provides them.
- The profile popover opens above the profile card and includes Add, Manage Profiles and Settings.
- Keyboard shortcuts: ⌘R to reload, ⇧⌘R to update the guide, ⌘N to add a playlist, ⌥⌘P to manage playlists, and ⌘, for Settings.
]]></description>
